# Localization — English Only

## Edit only `en.json`

- Path: `packages/excalidraw/locales/en.json`
- All other locale files (`fr-FR.json`, `de-DE.json`, etc.) are **Crowdin-managed**
- Do not hand-edit non-English locale files in feature PRs
- `percentages.json` is generated — do not edit manually

## Wiring new strings

- Use `t("toolBar.X")`, `t("element.X")`, or nested keys under `labels`, `hints`, `toolBar`, `element`
- Keys are typed from `en.json` via `TranslationKeys`
- New toolbar tools need both `toolBar.*` and `element.*` entries
- Languages appear in the app only when coverage ≥ 85% (`i18n.ts` `COMPLETION_THRESHOLD`)

## Coverage check

```bash
yarn locales-coverage
```

For multi-task demos comparing locales, diff keys in `en.json` against another locale — report missing keys, do not fill them in.
